---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"lsirq\")"
---
Utility to display kernel interrupt information

Usage: lsirq [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -J, --json                   Use JSON output format
  -P, --pairs                  Use key="value" output format
  -n, --noheadings             Don't print headings
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>        Output columns to print
  -s, --sort <SORT>            Sort by column name
  -S, --softirq                Show softirqs instead of interrupts
  -t, --threshold <THRESHOLD>  Only IRQs with counters above this threshold
  -C, --cpu-list <CPU_LIST>    Only show counters for these CPUs
  -h, --help                   Print help
